# Findings are documented in docs/; the raw images stay local.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
images/
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.heic
*.MACRO_FOCUS.jpg

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Video: demo recordings and everything derived from them. Raw phone footage
# runs to hundreds of MB per file and shows the van interior. Keep local.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.avi
*.m4v
*.webm
*.mts

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
